    "pageid": 127854,
    "revid": 833374,
    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"messagebox-main\">\n<div class=\"messagebox-image nomobile\" style=\"\">\n<p><span class=\"notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Jukebox.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Jukebox.png/64px-Jukebox.png?19bed\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Jukebox.png/128px-Jukebox.png?19bed 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"messagebox-text\" style=\"\">\n<p><b>Century Raffle Exclusive</b><br />\n<b>Hephaestus&#39; Lucky Dip</b> is only obtainable during <a href=\"/w/Raffle_of_the_Century\" title=\"Raffle of the Century\">century celebrations</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"messagebox-aside\">\n</div>\n</div> \n<div class=\"infobox\"><div class=\"infobox-title\">Hephaestus' Lucky Dip</div><div class=\"infobox-panel\"><ul class=\"infobox-section-labels\"><li class=\"label-active\" style=\"display:none\"></li></ul><div class=\"section active\"><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><span class=\"mw-default-size pi-image-thumbnail\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Hephaestus&#39; Lucky Dip.png\"><img alt=\"Hephaestus&#39; Lucky Dip.png\" src=\"/images/Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip.png?fa1a9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"mcui-row\"><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-style=\"legendary\" data-minetip-title=\"&amp;6Hephaestus&#39; Lucky Dip\" data-minetip-text=\"&amp;8Consumable//&amp;7Dip your hand in and reach around/&amp;7to find a random &amp;6Hephaestus Pet/&amp;6Item&amp;7. Can be any of the following:/&amp;7▪ &amp;6Hephaestus Plushie/&amp;7▪ &amp;6Hephaestus Relic/&amp;7▪ &amp;6Hephaestus Remedies/&amp;7▪ &amp;6Hephaestus Shelmet/&amp;7▪ &amp;6Hephaestus Souvenir/&amp;7▪ &amp;6Hephaestus Urn//&amp;8&amp;oStep right up and try your luck - will/&amp;8&amp;oyou win big or win even bigger?//&amp;eRight-click to consume!//&amp;8&amp;l* &amp;8Soulbound &amp;l*/&amp;6&amp;lLEGENDARY\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Hephaestus&#39; Lucky Dip\"><img alt=\"Hephaestus&#39; Lucky Dip.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip.png/32px-Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip.png?fa1a9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip.png/64px-Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip.png?fa1a9 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Type</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<a href=\"/w/Consumable\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Consumable\">Consumable</a></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Rarity</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span data-sort-value=\"4\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Legendary\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">LEGENDARY</span></span></a></span></div></div><div class=\"group layout-horizontal\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Item Properties</div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\"><abbr title=\"Whether or not the item(s) can be sold to an NPC. If an item is not salable but has enchantments on it, it becomes salable.\" tabindex=\"0\">Salable</abbr></div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-c\">✕</span></span> <span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\"><b>No</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Tradeable</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-c\">✕</span></span> <span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\"><b>No</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Auctionable</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-c\">✕</span></span> <span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\"><b>No</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\"><abbr title=\"Whether or not the item(s) can be donated to the Museum\" tabindex=\"0\">Museum</abbr></div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-c\">✕</span></span> <span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\"><b>No</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Soulbound</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-a\">✔</span></span> <span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\"><b>Yes</b></span> (Solo)</div></div></div><div class=\"group\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(1, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Item Metadata</div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Item ID</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<code>HEPHAESTUS_LUCKY_DIP</code></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n<p><b>Hephaestus' Lucky Dip</b> is a <span data-sort-value=\"4\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Legendary\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">LEGENDARY</span></span></a></span> consumable. It is unlocked from the <a href=\"/w/Raffle_of_the_Century\" title=\"Raffle of the Century\">Raffle of the Century</a> during Year 500.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Obtaining\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Obtaining</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Usage\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Usage</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Game_Message\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Game Message</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip?section=1&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Obtaining\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Obtaining\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p><b>Hephaestus' Lucky Dip</b> is a <span class=\"color-gold\"><b>MEDIUM</b></span> reward from the Year 500 <a href=\"/w/Raffle_of_the_Century\" title=\"Raffle of the Century\">Raffle of the Century</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Usage\">Usage</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip?section=2&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Usage\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Usage\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Consuming <b>Hephaestus' Lucky Dip</b> plays an animation and rewards the player randomly with one of the following items: \n</p>\n<div class=\"treeview\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip\" title=\"Hephaestus&#39; Lucky Dip\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip.png/21px-Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip.png?fa1a9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip.png/42px-Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip.png?fa1a9 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">1</span>&#160;<a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Hephaestus' Lucky Dip</a>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Hephaestus_Plushie\" title=\"Hephaestus Plushie\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Hephaestus_Plushie.png/21px-Hephaestus_Plushie.png?0ce1f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Hephaestus_Plushie.png/42px-Hephaestus_Plushie.png?0ce1f 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">1</span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Hephaestus_Plushie\" title=\"Hephaestus Plushie\">Hephaestus Plushie</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Hephaestus_Relic\" title=\"Hephaestus Relic\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Hephaestus_Relic.png/21px-Hephaestus_Relic.png?32a9b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Hephaestus_Relic.png/42px-Hephaestus_Relic.png?32a9b 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">1</span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Hephaestus_Relic\" title=\"Hephaestus Relic\">Hephaestus Relic</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Hephaestus_Remedies\" title=\"Hephaestus Remedies\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Hephaestus_Remedies.png/21px-Hephaestus_Remedies.png?047e8\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Hephaestus_Remedies.png/42px-Hephaestus_Remedies.png?047e8 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">1</span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Hephaestus_Remedies\" title=\"Hephaestus Remedies\">Hephaestus Remedies</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Hephaestus_Souvenir\" title=\"Hephaestus Souvenir\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Hephaestus_Souvenir.png/21px-Hephaestus_Souvenir.png?8c727\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Hephaestus_Souvenir.png/42px-Hephaestus_Souvenir.png?8c727 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">1</span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Hephaestus_Souvenir\" title=\"Hephaestus Souvenir\">Hephaestus Souvenir</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Hephaestus_Shelmet\" title=\"Hephaestus Shelmet\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Hephaestus_Shelmet.png/21px-Hephaestus_Shelmet.png?d1756\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Hephaestus_Shelmet.png/42px-Hephaestus_Shelmet.png?d1756 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">1</span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Hephaestus_Shelmet\" title=\"Hephaestus Shelmet\">Hephaestus Shelmet</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Hephaestus_Urn\" title=\"Hephaestus Urn\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Hephaestus_Urn.png/21px-Hephaestus_Urn.png?297d2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Hephaestus_Urn.png/42px-Hephaestus_Urn.png?297d2 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">1</span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Hephaestus_Urn\" title=\"Hephaestus Urn\">Hephaestus Urn</a></li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Game_Message\">Game Message</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip?section=3&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Game Message\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip?action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Game Message\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Condition\n</th>\n<th>Message\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">Consuming\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-d\"><span class=\"format-l\">WOW! </span></span><span class=\"format-e\">You found a </span><span class=\"format-6\">&lt;item&gt; </span><span class=\"format-e\">inside the lucky dip!</span></div></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"History\">History</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip?section=4&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip?action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: History\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable pixelated\" data-description=\"History\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/Alpha_Hypixel_Network\" title=\"Alpha Hypixel Network\">Alpha Hypixel Network</a></th></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2026/June_16\" title=\"Changelog/2026/June 16\">Jun&#160;16,&#160;2026</a></th><td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip.png/26px-Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip.png?fa1a9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip.png/52px-Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip.png?fa1a9 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span> Added <b>Hephaestus' Lucky Dip</b>.</td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/SkyBlock_Prototype\" title=\"SkyBlock Prototype\">SkyBlock Prototype</a></th></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2026/June_29\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Changelog/2026/June 29\">Jun&#160;29,&#160;2026</a></th><td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip.png/26px-Hephaestus%27_Lucky_Dip.png?fa1a9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Hephaestus%2